\f1\b \cf0 /Stan Simulation -
\f0\b0  Contains scripts for generating simulations of metabarcoding data and estimating models for simulation output using Stan (Model B as described in Supplement S1).  There are separate subfolders and scripts for analyzing data from a single marker (1_marker) and for combining data from two markers (2_marker)\
\

\f1\b /Stan Simulation/1_marker/ - 
\f0\b0 This folder contains six files simulation and estimate for a single metabarcoding marker.\

\f1\b ./01_run_stan_iterate_single_marker.R 
\f0\b0 is the main scripts that calls each of the subsequent scripts.  This file controls the simulation and subsequent estimation of metabarcoding simulations.\

